{
  "$comment": "C92.1 (ADR 0006): where the operator's network:sync fetches each network source. Live network data never comes from git: this file names the publications, their caps and their terms. No change signal is read (owner decision 10 after Workflow 6B): every check downloads and compares the SHA-256.",
  "format": "openverify/network-sources/v1",
  "guards": {
    "mass_removal_share": 0.25,
    "mass_addition_share": 0.25,
    "mmdb_min_size_share": 0.5,
    "basis": "provisional (C92.2): a range or exit set may lose or a range set gain at most a quarter of its addresses, higher than the watchlists' 10% because exit lists churn hourly; an MMDB may shrink to half its applied size. Unmeasured on live churn; to be calibrated."
  },
